    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Cosy, 2 Bedroom Mid-Terrace Property\r\n\r\nNo. 10 Mahony’s Place is a superbly located 2 Bedroom property which has recently been renovated to include new windows, roof, external wrapping, a new boiler and beautifully finished shower room making this property ready for immediate occupation. \r\n\r\nLocation wise it’s second to none, being just a 5 minute walk from Cork City centre & all amenities.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by prior appointment with the sole selling agent."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION:\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway : 2.4 x 0.81 tiled floor.\r\n\r\nOpen Plan Kitchen/Dining/Living Room:- 5.86 x 3.64 Open fire, timber floor, built-in units & eye level presses. Door to rear.\r\n\r\nShower Room : 3.05 x 0.77  tiled floor to ceiling, w.c., cabinet whb & pumped shower.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR :\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 3.40 x 3.12 Timber floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 : 2.52 x 2.5 Timber floor.\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE:  Small enclosed yard to the rear."
      },
